(text "MCU and Upstream PD Control" (at 12 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "64dcc26f-aa04-5c44-a1ba-c50e06eb44f6"))
(text "Named nets connect the circuit blocks on this sheet and across the hierarchy." (at 12 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6d38520c-46bf-5149-8ce3-69748ff26d94"))
(text "STM32G071 - USB-PD policy and power control" (at 12.0 45 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "10bb5e77-8144-52a0-bd60-3e54f61504f2"))
(text "STM32G071KBT6N LQFP32: PA8=UCPD1_CC1, PB15=UCPD1_CC2, PB6/PB7=I2C1, PA13/PA14=SWD.\nSource-only power path. UCPD dead-battery pins grounded; disable dead-battery function in firmware.\nBoot from flash using option bytes; preserve NRST function. Firmware required; no PD stack is generated here." (at 12.0 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "552c2b67-7ff2-5f20-a412-3680a52f5b45"))
(text "Upstream Type-C - USB data UFP / PD source" (at 596.2 45 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d219888e-e835-5ee9-a034-ac92dc8153fb"))
(text "STM32 UCPD negotiates PD and manages data-role swap to UFP while keeping power-source role.\nTCPP03 source path: common-source back-to-back FETs. Sink path not fitted. 7 mOhm gives nominal 6 A hardware OCP.\n100 W requires identified 5 A e-marked cable; otherwise cap contract to 3 A. Hardware OVP ceiling ~22 V." (at 596.2 52 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f8061baf-c211-57d9-a903-17619fa75411"))
